    "description": {
      "value": "Moss and winding vines give this gnarled staff of wild wood a vibrant green tinge. You created this staff to aid you in speaking to the plants you met on your adventure and beseeching them to come to your aid.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- **3rd** tree shape, wall of thorns\n- **4th** barkskin, speak with plants"
